            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "cspham"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I like the taste but using the recipe provided, I ended up with a really gooey palitao so I ended up having to add more rice flour until it was hard enough to form balls with. I love the taste though. It's exactly how I remembered it. Thanks for the recipe!",
            "datePublished": "2010-08-25T06:08:47.963Z"
